e-bot",{"title":177,"path":178,"stem":179,"icon":180},"Observability","\u002Fplatform\u002Fobservability","02.platform\u002F08.observability","i-lucide-activity",{"title":182,"path":183,"stem":184,"icon":185},"Contributing","\u002Fplatform\u002Fcontributing","02.platform\u002F09.contributing","i-lucide-git-pull-request",{"title":187,"path":188,"stem":189,"icon":190},"System Migrations","\u002Fplatform\u002Fsystem-migrations","02.platform\u002F10.system-migrations","i-lucide-database-zap",{"title":124,"icon":125,"path":192,"stem":193,"children":194,"page":36},"\u002Fplatform\u002Freference","02.platform\u002F11.reference",[195],{"title":196,"path":197,"stem":198,"icon":199},"CRI Format","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fcri-format","02.platform\u002F11.reference\u002F01.cri-format","i-lucide-link",{"id":201,"title":11,"body":202,"description":406,"extension":407,"links":408,"meta":409,"navigation":410,"path":12,"seo":411,"stem":13,"__hash__":412},"docs\u002F01.apps\u002F01.introduction.md",{"type":203,"value":204,"toc":398},"minimark",[205,209,214,217,221,248,252,333,339,345,351,355,358,391],[206,207,208],"p",{},"Kinotic is a next-generation cloud operating system that abstracts away infrastructure complexity so developers and AI agents can focus on what matters: building great applications.",[210,211,213],"h2",{"id":212},"humane-representation-of-thought","Humane Representation of Thought",[206,215,216],{},"The rise of AI-assisted development has unlocked a new paradigm -- rapid iteration driven by natural-language intent and intelligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[210,218,220],{"id":219},"core-components","Core Components",[222,223,224,231,236,242],"ul",{},[225,226,227,230],"li",{},[228,229,5],"strong",{}," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[225,232,233,235],{},[228,234,139],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[225,237,238,241],{},[228,239,240],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[225,243,244,247],{},[228,245,246],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[210,249,251],{"id":250},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[253,254,255,271],"table",{},[256,257,258],"thead",{},[259,260,261,265,268],"tr",{},[262,263,264],"th",{},"Concern",[262,266,267],{},"Without Kinotic",[262,269,270],{},"With Kinotic",[272,273,274,286,301,312,323],"tbody",{},[259,275,276,280,283],{},[277,278,279],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[277,281,282],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[277,284,285],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[259,287,288,290,293],{},[277,289,59],{},[277,291,292],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[277,294,295,296,300],{},"Define entities, run ",[297,298,299],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[259,302,303,306,309],{},[277,304,305],{},"Service Mesh",[277,307,308],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[277,310,311],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[259,313,314,317,320],{},[277,315,316],{},"CI\u002FCD",[277,318,319],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[277,321,322],{},"Handled by the platform",[259,324,325,327,330],{},[277,326,177],{},[277,328,329],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[277,331,332],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[206,334,335,338],{},[228,336,337],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[206,340,341,344],{},[228,342,343],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[206,346,347,350],{},[228,348,349],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[210,352,354],{"id":353},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[206,356,357],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[359,360,361,366,371,376,381,386],"ol",{},[225,362,363,365],{},[228,364,15],{}," -- Scaffold a project and persist your first entity in under five minutes.",[225,367,368,370],{},[228,369,19],{}," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[225,372,373,375],{},[228,374,38],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[225,377,378,380],{},[228,379,59],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[225,382,383,385],{},[228,384,92],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[225,387,388,390],{},[228,389,103],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[206,392,393,394,397],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[395,396,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":399,"searchDepth":400,"depth":400,"links":401},"",2,[402,403,404,405],{"id":212,"depth":400,"text":213},{"id":219,"depth":400,"text":220},{"id":250,"depth":400,"text":251},{"id":353,"depth":400,"text":354},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":406},"kWAFExdJBuvap6cvr7VlVEwd-U_8NHeOdkZ707K3NTM",[408,414],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":415,"children":-1},"Get started building your first Kinotic App -- from a provisioned project to a running CRUD service in under five minutes.",1787794835189]